      "text": "无线流量"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-6",
      "text": "遇到WIFI密码破解的流量包时可以直接使用Kali的工具进行破解"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-6",
      "text": "aircrack-ng -w /usr/share/wordlists/wfuzz/general/big.txt ctf.pcapng\n"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-6",
      "text": "通过字典爆破得到密码之后，点击编辑==>首选项"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-6",
      "text": "image-20230318192313229"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-6",
      "text": "进入首选项找协议中的IEEE 802.11无线协议"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-6",
      "text": "image-20230318192457450"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-6",
      "text": "添加该无线流量包的密码点击OK即可 点击视图中的重新加载就能查看该加密流量包(此处Key Type应为wpa-pwd)"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-6",
      "text": "image-20230318193438375"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-6",
      "text": "TLS协议的证书也可以通过该位置的选项导入对应整数打开加密的流量包"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-7",
      "text": "SQL流量包"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-7",
      "text": "strings sqltest.pcapng | grep \"ascii\" > 1.txt #直接输出流量包中的信息到文本中\n"
