    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-14",
      "text": "追踪后发现一长串编码："
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-14",
      "text": "image-20230317193406600"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-14",
      "text": "结果有\"=\"号很有可能是base64编码，将编码复制到浏览器作为png的base64编码打开："
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-14",
      "text": "data:image/png;base64,这里跟编码\n"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
